==German==

===Etymology===

From Middle High German {{inh|de|gmh|walfisch}}, {{inh|de|gmh|walvisch}}, from Old High German {{inh|de|goh|walfisk}}, {{inh|de|goh|walfisc}}. {{surf|de|Wal|t1=whale|Fisch|t2=fish}}. Cognates include {{cog|nds-de|Waalfisk}}, {{cog|nl|walvis}}, {{cog|fy|walfisk}}, {{cog|stq|Waalfisk}}. 

